# test: profile_worktree
# description: A fresh worktree layout uses the wt template and generator and can start and probe its daemon

## Environment

config:
  name: fresh-tree
  worktree: true

terminal:
  name: T1

## Test

@T1
> amux server stop
Server shutting down.

> amux server start
Server started.

> amux profiles
Profiles:
  $fresh-tree.id  fresh-tree    unbound / local

> amux list
No agents running.

> amux server stop
Server shutting down.
